<title>USA: North Central buy back plan approved.</title>
<headline>North Central buy back plan approved.</headline>
<dateline>FORT DODGE, Iowa 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>North Central Bancshares Inc said on Wednesday that it received regulatory approval from the Office of Thrift Supervision today for a stock repurchase program.</p>
<p>The program authorizes the company to repurchase up to 10 percent of its 3.8 million outstanding shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The repurchases will be made from time to time, during a six month period in open market and privately negotiated transactions, at the discretion of management, the company said. Shares of North Central closed down 3/8 at 12-5/8 Wednesday.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
